  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A lightweight skin tint foundation with medium coverage that visibly brightens skin for a dewy, luminous finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and binds moisture to smooth and hydrate skin.</p><p>- Rice Bran Peptides: Reduces the appearance of fine lines and pores and fades the look of dark spots, visibly brightening skin tone.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p >-Start with a fresh canvas of clean, prepped skin.</p><p>-Shake to activate—separation is normal due to 85 percent skincare ingredients.</p><p>-Warm one pump onto fingertips, or pump directly onto The Base Brush (sold separately).</p><p>-Press into skin like you would a skincare serum until fully blended.</p><p>-Set where needed with Airset using The Fluffy Brush (each sold separately).</p><p>-Enjoy that Signature SaieGlow.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and binds moisture to smooth and hydrate skin</p><p>- Rice Bran Peptides: Reduces the appearance of fine lines, pore, helps fade dark spots brightening skin tone.</p><p>- Glycerin: A fatty acid known to increase skin’s natural moisture level.<span style=\"white-space:pre;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><br>Althaea Officinalis Root Extract, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Caprylhydroxamic Acid, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Dicaprylyl Ether, Glycerin, Glyceryl Caprylate, Magnesium Stearate, Mica, Neopentyl Glycol Diheptanoate, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Phyllanthus Emblica Fruit Extract, Polyester-7, Polyglutamic Acid, Polyglycerin - 6, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyhydroxystearate, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Sodium Chloride, Sodium Hyaluronate, Squalane, Stearic Acid, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Tocopherols, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Trihydroxystearin, Trioctyldodecyl Citrate, Water (Aqua), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491)<br>Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499).<br>.<br><br><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A lightweight skin tint foundation with medium coverage that visibly brightens skin for a dewy, luminous finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and binds moisture to smooth and hydrate skin.</p><p>- Rice Bran Peptides: Reduces the appearance of fine lines and pores and fades the look of dark spots, visibly brightening skin tone.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p >-Start with a fresh canvas of clean, prepped skin.</p><p>-Shake to activate—separation is normal due to 85 percent skincare ingredients.</p><p>-Warm one pump onto fingertips, or pump directly onto The Base Brush (sold separately).</p><p>-Press into skin like you would a skincare serum until fully blended.</p><p>-Set where needed with Airset using The Fluffy Brush (each sold separately).</p><p>-Enjoy that Signature SaieGlow.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and binds moisture to smooth and hydrate skin</p><p>- Rice Bran Peptides: Reduces the appearance of fine lines, pore, helps fade dark spots brightening skin tone.</p><p>- Glycerin: A fatty acid known to increase skin’s natural moisture level.<span style=\"white-space:pre;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><br>Althaea Officinalis Root Extract, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Caprylhydroxamic Acid, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Dicaprylyl Ether, Glycerin, Glyceryl Caprylate, Magnesium Stearate, Mica, Neopentyl Glycol Diheptanoate, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Phyllanthus Emblica Fruit Extract, Polyester-7, Polyglutamic Acid, Polyglycerin - 6, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyhydroxystearate, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Sodium Chloride, Sodium Hyaluronate, Squalane, Stearic Acid, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Tocopherols, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Trihydroxystearin, Trioctyldodecyl Citrate, Water (Aqua), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491)<br>Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499).<br>.<br><br><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
